sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant App
  participant API as Orders API
  participant Pay as Payments
  U->>App: Tap "Buy"
  App->>API: POST /orders
  API->>Pay: charge(card)
  alt card declined
    Pay-->>API: 402
    API-->>App: error
  else ok
    Pay-->>API: 200
    API-->>App: order id
  end
  Note over API,Pay: retried up to 3 times
